   Cause: the engine labels questions as question_number+1 of question_count.
   Exclusive Q3 branches occupy indices 2–5, so after healthcare the UI jumps
   to "Question 7 of 16" for what the player experiences as Q4. Terminal and
   unused branches also inflate the denominator.

   Preferred fix (display-only, no jump retargeting):

     1. Content spine (what players actually play on a normal run):
          NM_SPINE = [801, 802, (one of 803-806), 807, 808, 809, 810,
